            <ArticleTitle>How to improve home care pain management processes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>325-34</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article describes the process and tools one agency used when their ORYX indicator, &quot;managing a patient's pain,&quot; was consistently below the national benchmark. The process can be used for addressing Adverse Events through the OBQI Process as well.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
